      "label": "Employed perons aged 15-74 (LFS) by average of actual hours worked, hours of absence and overtime hours per week and share of full-time workers (main job) and also by born in Sweden/foreign born, sex and age. Year 2005-2025",
      "source": "Statistics Sweden",
      "updated": "2026-01-23T07:00:00Z",
      "link": {
